    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald are delighted to present No. 42 Hollywoodrath Avenue to the market. Ideally located opposite a large green area, No. 42 is a beautifully presented 5 bedroomed detached family home, built in 2018. Measuring 180 sq.m./ 1,941 sq.ft. approx., The property is in a highly desirable location close to shops, schools and public transport to the city centre and surrounding areas. The property benefits from a versatile attic conversion with en-suite, walk in wardrobe and office space which is an additional 33 sq.m approx. of versatile accommodation, that could be used as a bedroom, playroom or gym.\n\nOn entering the home, you are welcomed into the bright and spacious hallway with stairs leading to first floor landing opening to both the living room, kitchen/dining room, playroom and downstairs WC. The living room is a fantastic entertaining space, with bay window to front aspect and feature electric fire. The playroom seamlessly flows through double doors into the open plan kitchen and dining room area. The open plan kitchen/dining room is a great space for family dinners and entertaining. The kitchen itself is fitted with soft grey base/wall units with sizeable worktops, built in island, inset sink with mixer tap. From the kitchen there is also a sizable utility room, fitted with base units and space for washing machine and dryer. \n\nUpstairs on the first floor, there are four generous double bedrooms, all with fitted wardrobes, with the master bedroom benefiting from an en-suite shower room and dressing room area. The family bathroom is well-appointed with a bath, shower unit, wash hand basin, WC, heated towel rail, and stylish partially tiled walls and flooring.\n\nOutside to the front of the property there is a sizable driveway for two/ three cars with a side lawned area. Double gated side access to the enclosed private rear garden which is laid in lawn with a patio area.\n\nThis home combines practical family living, stylish finishes, and a highly convenient location, making it a truly exceptional property\n\nHollywoodrath Road is a peaceful, affluent estate, with a good selection of shopping and leisure facilities both locally and within a ten-minute drive. There is easy access to the city centre, N3/M3/M50, Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, and Dublin Airport."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 7.2m x 2m\nWelcoming hallway finished with laminate wooden flooring. Features staircase with carpet, WC, bespoke storage and spot lighting.\n\nLiving Room - 4.2m x 3.96m\nStylish living room featuring an electric fire set and bespoke storage. The room is finished with laminate flooring and benefits from a bay window to the front, offering pleasant views overlooking a green area.\n\nPlayroom / library - 3.9m x 3.5m\nFeaturing laminate flooring. Double doors open through to the kitchen/dining room, creating an ideal family-friendly flow between spaces.\n\nKitchen/Dining - 6.3m x 5.25m\nSpacious and light-filled kitchen/dining area featuring tied flooring and two skylights allowing natural light flow through out. The kitchen is fitted with a induction hob, oven, and granite work tops. A central island provides additional workspace and incorporates a dual sink with drainer and modern mixer tap.\n\nUtility Room - 1.9m x 1.49m\nFitted with shelfing units providing practical storage. Plumbed for both a washing machine and dryer. Finished with durable tiled flooring.\n\nWC - 1.59m x 1.4m\nConveniently located guest bathroom with tiled flooring, a WC and wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.1m x 3.3m\nLarge double bedroom located to the front of the property and fully fitted wardrobes. Carpet flooring.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.57m x 1.19m\nEn-Suite Comprises of, shower unit, wc, wash hand basin and heated towel rail. Partly tiled walls and tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4m x 2.9m\nGenerous sized double bedroom to the rear of the house with fully fitted wardrobes. Carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.9m x 2.8m\nGood sized double bedroom to the rear of the house with built in wardrobes. Carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.3m x 2.8m\nGenerous sized single bedroom to the front of the house with carpet flooring.\n\nBathroom - 3.1m x 2m\nWell-appointed bathroom comprising a bath and a separate shower unit. Features include a wash hand basin, WC, heated towel rail and partially tiled walls and flooring.\n\nBedroom 5 - 5.16m x 3.4m\nVersatile attic room offering potential as an additional bedroom, reception space, home office, gym or playroom. Fitted with skylights for natural light, carpet flooring, office space, walk in wardrobe, ensuite and access to eaves storage.\n\nEnsuite / Walk in Wardrobe - 5.16m x 1.4m\nWith WC, wash hand basin, heated towel rail, stylish hexagon tiling.Walk in wardrobe\n\nOffice - 2.1m x 1.27m\nWith carpet flooring\n\n"
      },
